    "detailed_description": "Conquer the Catch Royale's everchanging seasonal maps as a hunter and catch them foxes or flip the coin, show your inner escape artist, and choose to be part of the foxes team.<br><br>The concept is plain and simple: The hunters' task is to tag them foxes, aka catch them, as the name indicates. However, the longer you survive as a fox, the higher your reward is.<br><br>Various settings, various parameters:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Try out Party mode, in which, instead of the standard 100-player mode, you can battle amongst 250 other fighters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For the full experience, we added an optional Smart AI mode, in which you can set the other AI-handled foxes and hunters to find the optimal route to simulate the best experience.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can I do with my XP?</h2>The game offers 20 skins you can earn as you go up the staircase of experience points, each with a 5000 XP gap.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Future features that are yet to come:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plain multiplayer mode<br></li><li>Replay mode<br></li><li>Create and publish your levels</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Conquer the Catch Royale's everchanging seasonal maps as a hunter and catch them foxes or flip the coin, show your inner escape artist, and choose to be part of the foxes team.<br><br>The concept is plain and simple: The hunters' task is to tag them foxes, aka catch them, as the name indicates. However, the longer you survive as a fox, the higher your reward is.<br><br>Various settings, various parameters:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Try out Party mode, in which, instead of the standard 100-player mode, you can battle amongst 250 other fighters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For the full experience, we added an optional Smart AI mode, in which you can set the other AI-handled foxes and hunters to find the optimal route to simulate the best experience.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can I do with my XP?</h2>The game offers 20 skins you can earn as you go up the staircase of experience points, each with a 5000 XP gap.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Future features that are yet to come:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plain multiplayer mode<br></li><li>Replay mode<br></li><li>Create and publish your levels</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Remember playing tag? We spiced it up a little bit: Immerse yourself in Catch Royale: A stylized free-to-play Battle-Royale game with up to 250 players.",
